'''Jinfore Volcano''' (ジャンフォレ火山, ''Janfore Kazan'', '''Janfore Volcano''') is a [[Behemoth Culling]] map added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]] and unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. It can drop any color [[Catfruit|Behemoth Stone]] except Epic, but is less consistent in dropping Red and Purple Behemoth Stones compared to [[Hidden Forest of Gapra]] and Green and Blue Behemoth Stones compared to [[Ashvini Desert]], making Jinfore Volcano ideal for obtaining Yellow Behemoth Stones. In terms of [[Ototo Corps|materials]], stages 1-4 can drop either Coal, Sprockets, or Meteorites. After clearing any stage in Jinfore Volcano, the map will disappear until the next day.

