==Trivia==
*Like [[Hidden Forest of Gapra]] and [[Ashvini Desert]], Jinfore Volcano is named after a breed of cat, in this case the [[wikipedia:Norwegian Forest cat|Norwegian Forest Cat]] (Jinfore's name in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] is Janfore, which is written as ジャンフォレ, while Norwegian Forest Cat in Japanese is ノルウェー<u>ジャンフォレ</u>ストキャット).

